#. ………………
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. あ、葉隠クン！
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, hey Hiro!"
msgstr ""

#. …うぉっ！　苗木っち！？
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Uwah! Makoto!?"
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうしたの？　そんなに驚いて…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Why'd you act so surprised...?"
msgstr ""

#. い、いや…なんでもねーけど…
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "O-Oh, no reason!"
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠クンも、さっきのモノクマアナウンスを聞いて、
#. 体育館に来たんだよね？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You heard Monokuma's announcement, right? Are you here\n"
"to find out what he has to say?"
msgstr ""

#. お、俺は…
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I...I..."
msgstr ""

#. もう行ってきた…
#. だから…帰るトコだべ…
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I just did, actually. I'm on my way out..."
msgstr ""

#. え、もう聞いたの！？
#. モノクマのヒントってなんだったの？
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You already talked to him? What'd he say!?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. わ、悪いけど…俺は…！
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Listen, sorry, b-but I...!"
msgstr ""

#. これで失礼すんべ！！
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I gotta go!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、ちょっと葉隠クン！！
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hiro, wait!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>呼び止める声もむなしく、
#. 葉隠クンは逃げるように走り去ってしまった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There was no point in trying to stop him. He ran off\n"
"like a frightened animal.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. は、葉隠…クン…？
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-Hiro...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうして、あんな…
#. ボクを避けるみたいに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was like he was trying to avoid me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンには、<CLT><CLT 3>ロッカールームのノートの件<CLT><CLT 4>も
#. 確認しておきたかったのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I was hoping to talk to him about <CLT><CLT 3>the notebook I\n"
"found in the locker<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり…何か隠し事が…？
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Has he been hiding something this whole time?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とにかく、今は体育館に向かおう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Anyway, for now I'd better get to the gym...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラなんかより…
#. とにかく、今は体育館に向かおう！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now I'm more worried about getting to the gym\n"
"than some damn surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とにかく、今は体育館に向かおう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Anyway, for now I'd better get to the gym...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンの様子は気になるけど…
#. 今は体育館に向かおう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm worried about how Hiro was acting, but...right now\n"
"I need to get to the gym.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
